# Redirects for the static export, read by Cloudflare from the root of the
# assets directory (see wrangler.jsonc). These are routes retired in the
# operating-ecosystem restructure — the export has no page at either path any
# more, so without these both 404. Keep them as long as the old URLs may
# still be linked or indexed.
#
# Matching is on the path as written, so each one is listed with and without
# the trailing slash. HTTPS and the canonical non-www host are NOT handled
# here: host-level rules belong in the Cloudflare dashboard (SSL/TLS >
# "Always Use HTTPS", plus a redirect rule for www.sttps.co), because this
# file is path-only.

/blogs                          /news/        301
/blogs/                         /news/        301
/about/corporate-governance     /governance/  301
/about/corporate-governance/    /governance/  301
